/// Network Directory projection (v0)
///
/// Contract:
/// - Rooted at `NetworkDirectory`.
/// - Service-owned territory discovery reads from Network read models derived from commits.
/// - Does not own mutable child facts; those remain in node/peer lanes and are read from
///   committed Network projection tables.

projection NetworkDirectory {
    root network.NetworkDirectory

    observable territory {
        """
        Network territory and experience discovery scope.
        """
    }
}
